# Beyond Infinity, Qu'Bia Arena (battlefield.beyond_infinity): the registrant's requirements. main has the quest
# accepted but no clasp, bob has the clasp but the quest only available: each gets the requirements message and a
# release, no menu. cat and dan are declared and never log in or trigger.
lists QubiaArena/BC_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity accepted
bob: keyitem SoulGemClasp
login
bob: login
trigger BC_Entrance
bob: trigger BC_Entrance
